  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police are conducting a broad investigation into allegations of illegal wiretapping targeting the President, which authorities have linked to a larger treason case. As part of these legal proceedings, officials confirmed that six suspects have been named, including a civilian recently taken in for questioning. Bareskrim Polri is focusing its efforts on tracing financial transactions, specifically looking into hundreds of millions of rupiah that may have supported these activities. Meanwhile, three generals implicated in the monitoring of the President were reassigned to the Yanma Polri division. Political figures from various parties have urged the police to maintain transparency and to identify any potential political actors who may have orchestrated the operation. Investigations remain active as police continue to analyze evidence gathered during recent searches related to the case.",
